---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroImage from '../assets/DSC00875-HDR-Large.jpg';
import clinicImg2 from '../assets/DSC00930-Large.jpg';
import clinicImg3 from '../assets/external1.png';
import clinicImg4 from '../assets/external2.png';
import clinicImg5 from '../assets/DSC00878-Large.jpg';
import logo from '../assets/logo.jpg';

const phoneNumber = '+212661530407';
const phoneDisplay = '06 61 53 04 07';
const whatsappNumber = '212661530407';
---

<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@400,0..1&display=swap"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@400,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'"/>
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@400,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></noscript>

<nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 w-full bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-slate-100 shadow-sm">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center h-20">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<Image src={logo} alt="CDTM Logo" class="h-10 md:h-12 w-auto drop-shadow-sm rounded-lg" width={64} height={64} />
<div>
<p class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#003366] leading-none">Clinique Dentaire <span class="text-[#0077A8]">Témara Mall</span></p>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[10px] text-[#0077A8] filled">location_on</span>
                        Témara Mall, 4ème étage
                    </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-4">
<a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#003366] text-sm font-bold py-2.5 px-4 sm:px-5 rounded-full border-2 border-[#003366]/20 bg-blue-50 sm:bg-transparent hover:border-[#003366] hover:bg-[#003366] hover:text-white transition-all" href={`tel:${phoneNumber}`} data-cta="header-phone">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">call</span>
<span class="hidden sm:inline">Appelez Dr. SABAOUI : {phoneDisplay}</span>
                </a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</nav>

<main>
<section id="hero-section" class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white overflow-hidden pt-8 pb-16 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-24">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/patterns/cubes.png')] opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6 text-center lg:text-left order-1">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 text-[#003366] w-fit mx-auto lg:mx-0 shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] text-sm filled">verified</span>
<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Spécialiste en Implantologie à Témara</span>
</div>
<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-black text-[#003366] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
                    Implants Dentaires à Témara — <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0077B6] to-blue-400">Expertise et Confiance</span>
</h1>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 leading-relaxed">
                    Vous avez perdu une ou plusieurs dents ? Dr. SABAOUI, spécialiste en implantologie (diplômé de l'Université de Gênes), vous accompagne du diagnostic à la pose — dans un cadre moderne et accessible, au cœur de Témara Mall.
                </p>
<div class="flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-2 sm:gap-4 mt-2">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white py-1.5 px-3 sm:py-2 sm:px-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
<img alt="Google" class="h-6" width="24" height="24" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCyJTKXxp08-Xo1n0FWsTUx6xhzulq-H-D8NiK0lt1_DZPCuSyzXL_QoO98RwGKmAMuHq-rGezF6g6W6Q3y40QF3uzwXIiUZ82d-vbWoiWFND5I_S2gHEBTmWEbrnL3DEoMHhD1blV_lBbJlE_1v8Fc8wGzuRjQHyO29FpfAJfc_D9JlmYGrL4XoDWoV7g5Kabw_CffKkBIdqtc2NvPKt9JfeGAjJizkO7Sw_4XT3AQdtLriHotHlV7pHvIGOztP4yav_FNzQXlTw=s48"/>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
</div>
<span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">5/5 sur 100+ avis Google</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white py-1.5 px-3 sm:py-2 sm:px-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8]">storefront</span>
<div class="flex flex-col text-left">
<span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800">Situé au</span>
<span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Témara Mall, 4ème étage</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 py-1.5 px-3 sm:py-2 sm:px-4 rounded-lg border border-blue-100">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8]">verified_user</span>
<span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#003366]">Garantie à Vie sur Implants</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3 mt-4 w-full sm:w-auto">
<a href={`tel:${phoneNumber}`} class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#0077B6] hover:bg-[#005f94] text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#0077B6]/30 hover:-translate-y-0.5 w-full sm:w-auto" data-cta="hero-cta">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">call</span>
                        Appelez Maintenant
                    </a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 w-full order-2">
<div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white">
<!-- Carousel track -->
<div class="flex overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory" id="hero-carousel" style="-ms-overflow-style:none;scrollbar-width:none;">
<div class="min-w-full snap-start">
<Image
  src={heroImage}
  alt="Cabinet moderne — Clinique Dentaire Témara Mall"
  class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover object-top"
  widths={[400, 768]}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw"
  format="webp"
  quality={80}
  loading="eager"
  fetchpriority="high"
/>
</div>
<div class="min-w-full snap-start">
<Image
  src={clinicImg2}
  alt="Espace de soins moderne"
  class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover object-top"
  widths={[400, 768]}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw"
  format="webp"
  quality={85}
  loading="lazy"
/>
</div>
<div class="min-w-full snap-start">
<Image
  src={clinicImg3}
  alt="Vue extérieure — Résidence Témara Mall 2"
  class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover object-center"
  widths={[400, 768, 1024]}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw"
  format="webp"
  quality={70}
  loading="lazy"
/>
</div>
<div class="min-w-full snap-start">
<Image
  src={clinicImg4}
  alt="Entrée du bâtiment Témara Mall 2"
  class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover object-center"
  widths={[400, 768]}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw"
  format="webp"
  quality={85}
  loading="lazy"
/>
</div>
<div class="min-w-full snap-start">
<Image
  src={clinicImg5}
  alt="Équipement dentaire de pointe"
  class="w-full h-[400px] object-cover object-top"
  widths={[400, 768]}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 42vw"
  format="webp"
  quality={85}
  loading="lazy"
/>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Dot indicators -->
<div class="absolute bottom-[72px] left-0 w-full flex justify-center gap-1.5 z-10">
<button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 p-1 rounded-full bg-white" style="opacity:1" aria-label="Image 1"></button>
<button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 p-1 rounded-full bg-white" style="opacity:0.4" aria-label="Image 2"></button>
<button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 p-1 rounded-full bg-white" style="opacity:0.4" aria-label="Image 3"></button>
<button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 p-1 rounded-full bg-white" style="opacity:0.4" aria-label="Image 4"></button>
<button class="carousel-dot w-3 h-3 p-1 rounded-full bg-white" style="opacity:0.4" aria-label="Image 5"></button>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-[#003366]/90 to-transparent p-6 pt-20">
<p class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Dr. SABAOUI Otmane</p>
<p class="text-sm text-blue-200">Chirurgien Dentiste - Implantologue</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="border-y border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 py-10">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<p class="text-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest">Diplômes &amp; Spécialisations</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 md:gap-16 transition-all duration-500">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-slate-700">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">school</span> Faculté de Médecine Dentaire - Rabat
            </div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-slate-700">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">medical_services</span> Chirurgie Orale
            </div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-slate-700">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl md:text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">workspace_premium</span> Diplôme de l'Université de Gênes - Italie
            </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-20">
<div>
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#003366] mb-6">Votre Implant, en Toute Confiance</h2>
<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                    Sous la direction de <strong>Dr. SABAOUI Otmane</strong>, notre clinique moderne située au Témara Mall offre une expertise pointue en réhabilitation orale et esthétique dentaire.
                </p>
<ul class="space-y-4">
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] mt-1">check_circle</span>
<span class="text-slate-700">Expertise confirmée en implantologie et chirurgie orale.</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] mt-1">check_circle</span>
<span class="text-slate-700">Protocoles de stérilisation stricts et équipements de pointe.</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] mt-1">check_circle</span>
<span class="text-slate-700">Emplacement accessible au cœur du Témara Mall.</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100">
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#003366] mb-6">Nos Solutions Implantaires</h3>
<div class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[#0077A8] shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">dentistry</span>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Implant Unitaire</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Remplacement d'une seule dent manquante avec un implant et une couronne en céramique.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[#0077A8] shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">medical_services</span>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Bridge sur Implants</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Restauration de plusieurs dents avec un bridge fixé sur 2 à 4 implants. Solution durable et confortable.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 shrink-0 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[#0077A8] shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">healing</span>
</div>
<div>
<h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Greffe Osseuse</h4>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Reconstruction osseuse pré-implantaire pour les patients avec un volume osseux insuffisant.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Mid-page CTA -->
<div class="py-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0077B6] to-blue-500 text-center">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
<p class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Bilan personnalisé · Devis détaillé · Paiement par tranches · Feuilles de soins pour mutuelles</p>
<a href={`tel:${phoneNumber}`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-[#003366] font-bold py-3.5 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5" data-cta="midpage-cta">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">call</span>
            Appelez Maintenant
</a>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Treatment Process -->
<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#003366] text-center mb-4">Votre Parcours Implantaire</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">De la première consultation à votre nouveau sourire, un processus clair et encadré par Dr. SABAOUI.</p>
<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
<div class="text-center">
<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-[#0077B6]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">stethoscope</span>
</div>
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0077A8] mb-1">Étape 1</div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-[#003366] mb-2">Consultation & Diagnostic</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Examen clinique, radio panoramique et plan de traitement personnalisé.</p>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-[#0077B6]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">dentistry</span>
</div>
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0077A8] mb-1">Étape 2</div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-[#003366] mb-2">Pose de l'Implant</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Intervention sous anesthésie locale, indolore. Durée : 15 à 30 minutes par implant.</p>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-[#0077B6]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">schedule</span>
</div>
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0077A8] mb-1">Étape 3</div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-[#003366] mb-2">Cicatrisation</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Période de 2 à 4 mois pour l'ostéointégration. Suivi régulier assuré.</p>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto bg-[#0077B6]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-[#0077A8]">emoji_emotions</span>
</div>
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0077A8] mb-1">Étape 4</div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-[#003366] mb-2">Pose de la Couronne</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Couronne en céramique sur mesure. Résultat naturel et durable.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Patient Testimonials -->
<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#003366] text-center mb-4">Ce Que Disent Nos Patients</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">Des sourires retrouvés grâce à l'expertise de Dr. SABAOUI.</p>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
<div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
<div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
</div>
<p class="text-slate-700 text-sm mb-4">"J'avais peur de la douleur, mais l'intervention s'est passée sans aucun souci. Aujourd'hui je mange et souris normalement. Merci Dr. SABAOUI !"</p>
<p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#003366]">Fatima Z., 52 ans — Témara</p>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Implant unitaire</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
<div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
</div>
<p class="text-slate-700 text-sm mb-4">"Clinique moderne et équipe très professionnelle. Dr. SABAOUI m'a tout expliqué clairement, du début à la fin. Je recommande à 100%."</p>
<p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#003366]">Ahmed M., 45 ans — Rabat</p>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Bridge sur implants</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
<div class="flex text-yellow-400 text-sm mb-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm filled">star</span>
</div>
<p class="text-slate-700 text-sm mb-4">"Après des années avec un dentier, j'ai enfin des dents fixes. Le résultat est magnifique et naturel. Les facilités de paiement m'ont beaucoup aidé."</p>
<p class="text-sm font-bold text-[#003366]">Khadija B., 61 ans — Salé</p>
<p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Implants multiples</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ / Objection Handling -->
<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50">
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#003366] text-center mb-12">Questions Fréquentes sur les Implants</h2>
<div class="space-y-4">
<details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group">
<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#003366] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
Est-ce que la pose d'un implant fait mal ?
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
Non. L'intervention se fait sous anesthésie locale et est totalement indolore. La plupart de nos patients sont surpris par le confort de la procédure. Après l'intervention, une légère gêne peut être ressentie pendant 2-3 jours, facilement gérée avec des antidouleurs classiques.
</div>
</details>
<details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group">
<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#003366] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
Combien de temps dure le traitement complet ?
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
Le traitement complet prend généralement 3 à 6 mois, incluant la période de cicatrisation. La pose de l'implant elle-même dure 15 à 30 minutes. Pendant la cicatrisation, vous portez une prothèse provisoire esthétique.
</div>
</details>
<details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group">
<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#003366] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
Quelle est la durée de vie d'un implant dentaire ?
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#0077A8] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
Avec une bonne hygiène bucco-dentaire et des visites de contrôle régulières, un implant dentaire peut durer toute la vie. La couronne sur l'implant a une durée de vie de 15 à 25 ans en moyenne. Nous offrons une garantie à vie sur nos implants.
</div>
</details>
<details class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden group">
<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer font-bold text-[#003366] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
